                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 2</hi>. The National Bank of the Republic of
                    Haiti will always have the right, if necessity should arise, to reduce the
                    salaries provided for in the present Decree, to reduce or to increase the number
                    of employees without, however, surpassing the total as foreseen here for
                    salaries of the personnel of the Special Service of Inspection.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 3</hi>. The employees of the Special Service of
                    Inspection of the Bank are required to conform to the regulations of the
                    National Bank of the Republic of Haiti.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 4</hi>. The Secretary of State for Finance is
                    entrusted with the execution of the present Decree.</p>
